    "body": "<div>\n            \n  <div class=\"section\">\n\n<p>The technical handbook for developers building websites with Zotonic. It guides\nyou through all aspects of the framework.</p>\n<div class=\"toctree-wrapper compound\">\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toctree-l1\"><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"/id/doc_developerguide_introduction\">Introduction</a></li>\n<li class=\"toctree-l1\"><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"/id/doc_developerguide_getting_started\">Getting Started</a></li>\n<li class=\"toctree-l1\"><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"/id/doc_developerguide_docker\">Docker</a></li>\n<li class=\"toctree-l1\"><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"/id/doc_developerguide_directory_structure\">Directory structure</a></li>\n<li class=\"toctree-l1\"><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"/id/doc_developerguide_sites\">Sites</a></li>\n<li class=\"toctree-l1\"><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"/id/doc_developerguide_status_site\">The Status site</a></li>\n<li class=\"toctree-l1\"><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"/id/doc_developerguide_controllers\">Controllers</a></li>\n<li class=\"toctree-l1\"><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"/id/doc_developerguide_dispatch_rules\">Dispatch rules</a></li>\n<li class=\"toctree-l1\"><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"/id/doc_developerguide_resources\">Resources</a></li>\n<li class=\"toctree-l1\"><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"/id/doc_developerguide_templates\">Templates</a></li>\n<li class=\"toctree-l1\"><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"/id/doc_developerguide_media\">Media</a></li>\n<li class=\"toctree-l1\"><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"/id/doc_developerguide_icons\">Icons</a></li>\n<li class=\"toctree-l1\"><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"/id/doc_developerguide_forms_and_validation\">Forms and validation</a></li>\n<li class=\"toctree-l1\"><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"/id/doc_developerguide_search\">Search</a></li>\n<li class=\"toctree-l1\"><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"/id/doc_developerguide_translation\">Translation</a></li>\n<li class=\"toctree-l1\"><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"/id/doc_developerguide_wires\">Wires</a></li>\n<li class=\"toctree-l1\"><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"/id/doc_developerguide_access_control\">Access control</a></li>\n<li class=\"toctree-l1\"><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"/id/doc_developerguide_modules\">Modules</a></li>\n<li class=\"toctree-l1\"><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"/id/doc_developerguide_notifications\">Notifications</a></li>\n<li class=\"toctree-l1\"><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"/id/doc_developerguide_server_browser_interaction\">Browser/server interaction</a></li>\n<li class=\"toctree-l1\"><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"/id/doc_developerguide_email\">E-mail handling</a></li>\n<li class=\"toctree-l1\"><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"/id/doc_developerguide_shell\">Command-line shell</a></li>\n<li class=\"toctree-l1\"><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"/id/doc_developerguide_logging\">Logging</a></li>\n<li class=\"toctree-l1\"><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"/id/doc_developerguide_testing\">Testing sites</a></li>\n<li class=\"toctree-l1\"><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"/id/doc_developerguide_deployment_index\">Deployment</a></li>\n<li class=\"toctree-l1\"><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"/id/doc_developerguide_troubleshooting\">Troubleshooting</a></li>\n<li class=\"toctree-l1\"><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"/id/doc_developerguide_contributing\">Contributing to Zotonic</a></li>\n<li class=\"toctree-l1\"><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"/id/doc_releasenotes_index\">Release Notes</a></li>\n<li class=\"toctree-l1\"><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"/id/doc_developerguide_upgrading\">Upgrade notes</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n           </div>",
